OL,3,ASpecialist courts for rape cases to be
OL,4,Arolled out across England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist courts to handle cases of
OL,7,Frape and other sexual offences will be
OL,8,Fintroduced across England and Wales
OL,9,Fover the next two years, the prime
OL,10,Fminister has announced.
OL,12,FEach crown court will have at least one
OL,13,Fcourtroom especially set up to hear
OL,14,Fsuch cases, while alleged victims will
OL,15,Fbe able to view proceedings remotely
OL,16,Fand give evidence from a separate room
OL,17,Fvia video link.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
